{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 197,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4344482421875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "assigned SAT. The same may apply to the selection of treatment support location, treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        296.87322998046875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "provider or other interventions in cohort studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.1985473632812,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "When treatment support alone was compared with SAT, patients who were on treatment support had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98178482055664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4013671875,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "better rates of treatment success, adherence and 2-month sputum conversion, and also had slightly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.556396484375,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "lower rates of loss to follow-up and acquired drug resistance. However, patients on treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977126121520996,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.3924560546875,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "had a slightly higher relapse rate. The GDG considered that, overall, the evidence was inconsistent in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4430541992188,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "showing clear advantages of treatment support alone over SAT or vice versa. However, the evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.5927124023438,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "showed that some subgroups of patients (e.g. TB patients living with HIV) with factors affecting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.45068359375,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "treatment adherence are likely to benefit from treatment support more than other patients do, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.22216796875,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "that specific types of treatment support delivery (e.g. locations of treatment support or support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.541748046875,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "providers) are likely to work better than others. The evidence also showed that, when patients received",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96394157409668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.420166015625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "treatment adherence interventions (e.g. different combinations of patient education, staff education,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.390380859375,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "material support, psychological support, tracers and use of medication monitor) in conjunction with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.5216674804688,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "treatment support or SAT, the treatment outcomes were significantly improved compared to treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.959124565124512,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        307.8369445800781,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "support with observation or SAT alone (see below).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.604248046875,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Only cohort studies were available to examine treatment support and SAT in HIV-positive TB patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990996360778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.3226318359375,
        527.5357055664062,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "(30–46) , and many of these studies were conducted in the pre-ART era prior to antiretroviral treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.963238716125488,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.5225830078125,
        527.4328002929688,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "(30, 31, 36,  (ART) or shortly after the introduction of this treatment for HIV-positive TB patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.72259521484375,
        527.3629150390625,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "39) . As above, treatment support could have been administered by a variety of people in a variety",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.6005249023438,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "of settings, including homes and clinics; occasionally, during initial intensive-phase treatment, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.3892211914062,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "treatment support was hospital-based. A few studies provided incentives and enablers or provided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.44091796875,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "treatment support only for persons considered to be at higher risk of loss to follow-up. HIV-positive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.4365844726562,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "TB patients on SAT had lower rates of treatment success, treatment completion and cure; they also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        524.400634765625,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "had higher rates of mortality, treatment failure and loss to follow-up. The evidence showed that HIV-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.5799560546875,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "positive TB patients, as a subgroup, benefit more from treatment support than TB patients in general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997249603271484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.4201049804688,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "do and that SAT alone is not advisable in HIV-positive TB patients. Reasons such as increased rates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.4421997070312,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "of drug–drug interactions and more severe disease in this cohort may cause treatment support to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        247.54153442382812,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "offer a significant advantage over SAT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.5025939941406,
        527.5289916992188,
        476.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support and SAT in MDR-TB patients were also examined in the systematic review. However,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964994430541992,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.426513671875,
        527.4066162109375,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "(33) very limited data were available from a cohort study  . There were higher rates of mortality and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.4422607421875,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "non-adherence and lower rates of treatment completion in MDR-TB patients on SAT compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        411.9200744628906,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "those on treatment support, although the differences were not significant.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.9464111328125,
        221.67855834960938,
        548.6064453125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support provider",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.5383911132812,
        527.4188232421875,
        570.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "(10, 12–14) (17, 18, 21, 23, 28, 32, 34–36, 42,  Randomized controlled trials   and observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        567.7384033203125,
        527.4183959960938,
        583.4573974609375
      ],
      "text": "46)  were available for examination of the effect of treatment support providers versus SAT. Providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.2142944335938,
        527.628662109375,
        596.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "were classed as health-care workers, lay providers or family members. The health-care worker group",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998250007629395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.4144287109375,
        527.4432373046875,
        609.857421875
      ],
      "text": "was varied and included personnel working at different levels of health-care systems and who had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.6143798828125,
        527.2055053710938,
        623.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "received health training. Health-care workers could be nurses, physicians or trained community",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.8143920898438,
        527.4189453125,
        636.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "health workers. Lay providers were also varied and could include teachers, community volunteers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.0142822265625,
        527.406982421875,
        649.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "or traditional healers. Treatment support by lay providers had higher rates of treatment success and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.2142944335938,
        527.4310913085938,
        662.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "cure, and a slightly lower rate of loss to follow-up compared with SAT. However, in one cohort study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.4144287109375,
        527.4332885742188,
        675.857421875
      ],
      "text": "there was a higher rate of treatment completion with SAT compared to treatment support with lay",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.6143798828125,
        527.447509765625,
        689.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "providers. Patients receiving treatment support from a family member had higher rates of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.8143920898438,
        527.5740356445312,
        702.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "success and lower rates of loss to follow-up compared with patients using SAT. When treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.0142822265625,
        527.3782958984375,
        715.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "support provided by a health-care worker was compared to SAT, there were higher rates of cure and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.2142944335938,
        527.4157104492188,
        728.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "adherence and lower rates of relapse and acquisition of drug resistance with the treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.4144287109375,
        527.2794799804688,
        741.857421875
      ],
      "text": "provided by a health-care worker. However, there was a higher rate of treatment completion with SAT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98784351348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.6143798828125,
        453.3438415527344,
        755.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "compared to treatment support provided by health-care workers in cohort studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 183",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}